  "body": "I apologize if this issue tracker is not the right place to suggest this:\r\n\r\nIs it possible to add another status \"owner\" for rooms like in XMPP? \r\nReason: If I set Administrators in a Room I can not \"disempower\" this users anymore. \r\n\r\nAn \"owner\" status should:\r\n- be the same as \"admin\" but with the additional right to disempower other admins.\r\n- be transferable (in case of you delete you account as owner of a high frequented used room and want to delegate this role)\r\n\r\nThx for Matrix and Riot!",
